   "text": {
    "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Public_schools\">Public schools</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=List_of_colleges_and_universities_in_the_United_States_by_endowment&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Public schools\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:University_of_texas_at_austin_main_building_2014.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/University_of_texas_at_austin_main_building_2014.jpg/250px-University_of_texas_at_austin_main_building_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/University_of_texas_at_austin_main_building_2014.jpg/500px-University_of_texas_at_austin_main_building_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2625\" data-file-height=\"2100\" /></a><figcaption>The <a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Texas_System\" title=\"University of Texas System\">University of Texas System</a> has the largest system-wide endowment of any American public higher education institution.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>For public universities, larger endowments are often associated with flagship state universities, especially those with <a href=\"/wiki/Medical_school\" title=\"Medical school\">medical schools</a>. Fourteen states do not have institutions included in this list: Alaska, Connecticut, Hawaii, Idaho, Maine, Montana, Nevada, New Mexico, North Dakota, Rhode Island, South Dakota, Vermont, West Virginia, and Wyoming.  Many of these states have small populations. The New England states, however, are known for well-endowed private institutions. \n</p><p>Data are from NACUBO as reported in spring of 2026<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NACUBO2025&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NACUBO2025-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, but some institutions do not report.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<caption>Endowment market values of US public institutions and systems, FY2024\u2013FY2025\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Rank</th>\n<th>Institution</th>\n<th>State</th>\n<th>FY2025<br />endowment<br />(billions USD)</th>\n<th>FY2024<br />endowment<br />(billions USD)</th>\n<th>Change<br />(%)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Texas_System\" title=\"University of Texas System\">The University of Texas System</a></td>\n<td>TX</td>\n<td>$27.17</td>\n<td>$24.74</td>\n<td>+9.81%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Texas_A%26M_University_System\" title=\"Texas A&amp;M University System\">The Texas A&amp;M University System &amp; Related Foundations</a></td>\n<td>TX</td>\n<td>$22.23</td>\n<td>$20.38</td>\n<td>+9.07%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Michigan\" title=\"University of Michigan\">University of Michigan</a></td>\n<td>MI</td>\n<td>$21.20</td>\n<td>$19.17</td>\n<td>+10.61%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_California\" title=\"University of California\">The Regents of the University of California</a></td>\n<td>CA</td>\n<td>$20.15</td>\n<td>$19.10</td>\n<td>+5.46%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Virginia\" title=\"University of Virginia\">University of Virginia</a></td>\n<td>VA</td>\n<td>$11.23</td>\n<td>$10.22</td>\n<td>+9.91%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ohio_State_University\" title=\"Ohio State University\">The Ohio State University</a></td>\n<td>OH</td>\n<td>$8.62</td>\n<td>$7.93</td>\n<td>+8.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Texas_at_Austin\" title=\"University of Texas at Austin\">The University of Texas at Austin</a></td>\n<td>TX</td>\n<td>$6.49</td>\n<td>$6.08</td>\n<td>+6.76%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Minnesota\" title=\"University of Minnesota\">University of Minnesota &amp; Foundations</a></td>\n<td>MN</td>\n<td>$6.45</td>\n<td>$5.94</td>\n<td>+8.65%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_North_Carolina_at_Chapel_Hill\" title=\"University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill\">University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill</a></td>\n<td>NC</td>\n<td>$6.22</td>\n<td>$5.73</td>\n<td>+8.62%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Pittsburgh\" title=\"University of Pittsburgh\">University of Pittsburgh</a></td>\n<td>PA</td>\n<td>$6.15</td>\n<td>$5.80</td>\n<td>+6.02%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pennsylvania_State_University\" title=\"Pennsylvania State University\">The Pennsylvania State University</a></td>\n<td>PA</td>\n<td>$5.06</td>\n<td>$4.77</td>\n<td>+6.14%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Wisconsin%E2%80%93Madison\" title=\"University of Wisconsin\u2013Madison\">University of Wisconsin Foundation</a></td>\n<td>WI</td>\n<td>$4.92</td>\n<td>$4.30</td>\n<td>+14.31%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/UCLA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"UCLA\">UCLA Foundation</a></td>\n<td>CA</td>\n<td>$4.77</td>\n<td>$4.30</td>\n<td>+10.89%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td